<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>PromptVibe HQ — Battle-Tested AI Prompts Directory</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Free production-ready AI prompt library for ChatGPT, Claude, and Midjourney." />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;1,6..72,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { background-color: #0e0e0e; color: #e0e0e0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
      .font-serif-title { font-family: 'Newsreader', serif; }
      .container { max-width: 1150px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; width: 100%; }
      header { border-bottom: 1px solid #262626; background-color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 0.9); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50; height: 80px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
      .header-content { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%; }
      .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
      .logo-dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; background-color: #22c55e; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }
      nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
      nav a { color: #a3a3a3; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; transition: color 0.2s; }
      nav a:hover { color: #fff; }
      
      .hero { padding: 80px 0 48px 0; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
      .badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 9999px; font-size: 12px; font-family: monospace; background-color: #171717; border: 1px solid #262626; color: #22c55e; }
      h1 { font-size: 58px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -1px; max-width: 800px; }
      h1 span { font-style: italic; color: #a3a3a3; }
      .hero-p { font-size: 18px; color: #a3a3a3; font-weight: 300; max-width: 600px; line-height: 1.6; }
      
      .cta-buttons { display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 12px; }
      .btn-main { background-color: #22c55e; color: #000; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 9999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 0.2s; }
      .btn-main:hover { background-color: #16a34a; }
      .btn-sec { background-color: #171717; border: 1px solid #262626; color: #fff; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 9999px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; transition: border-color 0.2s; }
      .btn-sec:hover { border-color: #404040; }

      .categories-section { padding: 48px 0 80px 0; border-top: 1px solid #262626; }
      .section-title { font-size: 32px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 32px; text-align: center; }
      .cat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
      .cat-card { background-color: rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.5); border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
      .cat-card:hover { border-color: #22c55e; transform: translateY(-3px); }
      .cat-card h3 { font-size: 22px; color: #fff; }
      .cat-card p { font-size: 14px; color: #a3a3a3; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.5; }
      .cat-link { font-size: 13px; font-family: monospace; color: #22c55e; margin-top: 8px; }

      footer { border-top: 1px solid #262626; margin-top: auto; padding: 40px 0; text-align: center; color: #737373; font-size: 12px; font-family: monospace; }
      .footer-links { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .footer-links a { color: #a3a3a3; text-decoration: none; }
      .footer-links a:hover { color: #fff; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    
    <header>
      <div class="container header-content">
        <a href="/" class="logo font-serif-title">
          <span class="logo-dot"></span>
          PromptVibe<span style="font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; color: #a3a3a3;">HQ</span>
        </a>
        <nav>
          <a href="/prompts">All Prompts</a>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
          <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
          <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container" style="flex-grow: 1;">
      <div class="hero">
        <div class="badge">
          <span>●</span> 100% Free AI Prompt Library
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-serif-title">
          Human prompts <br />
          <span>& AI engineering.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-p">
          Discover battle-tested, production-ready artificial intelligence prompts designed for ChatGPT, Claude, and Midjourney.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="/prompts" class="btn-main">Explore All Prompts →</a>
          <a href="/about" class="btn-sec">Learn More</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="categories-section">
        <h2 class="section-title font-serif-title">Browse Category Hubs</h2>
        <div class="cat-grid">
          <a href="/prompts" class="cat-card">
            <h3 class="font-serif-title">Engineering</h3>
            <p>Complex document summarization, code analysis, and system architecture prompts.</p>
            <span class="cat-link">Browse Library →</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/prompts" class="cat-card">
            <h3 class="font-serif-title">Marketing</h3>
            <p>High-converting cold email sequences, ad copies, and growth strategies.</p>
            <span class="cat-link">Browse Library →</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/prompts" class="cat-card">
            <h3 class="font-serif-title">Development</h3>
            <p>TypeScript code refactoring, bug fixing, and clean code optimization workflows.</p>
            <span class="cat-link">Browse Library →</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/prompts" class="cat-card">
            <h3 class="font-serif-title">Content</h3>
            <p>SEO-optimized blog outlines, long-form content planning, and copywriting frameworks.</p>
            <span class="cat-link">Browse Library →</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/prompts" class="cat-card">
            <h3 class="font-serif-title">Design</h3>
            <p>Photorealistic Midjourney parameters, cinematic lighting setups, and UI design prompts.</p>
            <span class="cat-link">Browse Library →</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/prompts" class="cat-card">
            <h3 class="font-serif-title">Sales</h3>
            <p>B2B objection handling strategies, pitch structuring, and conversion scripts.</p>
            <span class="cat-link">Browse Library →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/prompts">All Prompts</a>
        <a href="/about">About Us</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
      <p>© 2026 PromptVibe HQ. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>